WEBVTT

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:06.030
Shishio passed Atora's test

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.560
by working together
with Yoshimori and Tokine.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:13.810
As a result, he will continue to assist
the Kekkaishi of Karasumori.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:22.250
Sumimura Yoshimori, a junior high student,
and Yukimura Tokine, a high school student,

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.620
must guard the land
where their school now stands.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.720
To protect the Karasumori Site
from the Ayakashi.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:31.020
It is a duty passed down to them
from generation to generation.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:36.970
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.830
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:44.040
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.940
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:49.380
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:53.780
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:57.320
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.660
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:06.320
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.830
Sha la la la la...

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:17.240
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.210
(Secret romance)

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:24.410
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.180
(A strange distance)

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:33.020
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:34.090
Yeah

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:37.560
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:41.160
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:46.500
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.220
Well? How do you
like my conservatory?

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:11.150
I have no interest in greenhouses.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:14.260
It's not a greenhouse.
It's a conservatory.

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:17.690
As always, you're particular
about the strangest things.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.230
What do you want? What's this important
business you spoke of?

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:22.800
You never change either.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:28.070
I invited you, so why don't you
enjoy yourself in a bit of luxury?

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:37.010
I was going to enjoy a captivating teatime
with Kagami-kun, you know.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.450
Oh, Professor.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.020
Now, let's get down to business.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:49.890
I found the hideout of the Kokuboro.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.070
What?!

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.740
However, it is very difficult to get there.

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:56.030
It seems that they are
in the Other World.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:59.100
Hmmm... the Other World...

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:03.070
The Other World is like
a graceful lady.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.510
She won't even speak to strangers.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:11.610
Do you know the simplest way
to enter the Other World?

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:16.650
You need to have someone
over there invite you.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:20.620
That's why I was thinking of
befriending one of them.

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:24.730
But I was too naive.
Two of my daughters were killed.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:26.370
But they were Ayakashi...

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:30.860
Oh, Natsumi and Jennifer!
You were such wonderful daughters!

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:35.240
But thanks to them,
I was able to figure out some things.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:40.340
For some reason, they are trying to
come to a resolution quickly.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:47.180
I don't have enough information
to prove that conclusively.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:49.280
Heisuke.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.460
Don't get reckless.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:55.960
I asked for your help, but you
need not involve yourself too much.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:03.130
That's impossible.
I can't remove myself from this anymore.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:07.100
It seems they already
have their eye on me.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:13.840
Oh? It seems Sumimura is
comfortably asleep again today.

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:17.880
According to my data, he never wakes
even when the teacher goes near him.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.180
That's true.

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:23.190
Sorry, everyone.
Bear with me for a while.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:25.020
What is he going to do?

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.460
Whoa! He's doing that?!

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.470
Will he be able to endure it?!

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:39.510
That's Sumimura for you!
He's deeply asleep!

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:41.480
I guess I have no choice.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:47.910
Good morning, Sumimura.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:49.110
Yeah?

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:52.220
Open up your textbook.
It's called "Moerus's Flight".

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.110
It's a great piece that
no one should sleep through.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:05:02.820
In 360 BC, Moerus was to be executed
for sneaking into a palace.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.560
But he was given three days
to attend his little sister's wedding.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:12.070
In exchange, his best friend
was held hostage by the king.

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:12.730
Oh?

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:16.240
If he didn't return in time,
his friend would be executed.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.380
Moerus ran to his friend.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:24.450
He did not give up, no matter
what hardships awaited him.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:26.010
And then?

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:33.120
Moerus returned in time to save
his friend before the execution.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:38.930
The king was so moved by Moerus
that he pardoned him.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.440
And everyone lived
happily ever after.

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:45.000
That's the story.

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:46.400
Oh.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:49.500
But isn't that kind of weak?

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:50.340
What?

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:52.600
If it was up to me...

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:56.140
...I'd beat up the king!

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:00.020
Why?

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.820
He tried to kill my friend, right?

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:05.380
I would never let that slide!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:10.790
I'm sorry, I shouldn't have woken you.
Go back to sleep.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:18.000
I cannot acknowledge
Masamori's methods.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.470
However...

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:30.710
SUMIMURA RESIDENCE

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:35.680
Hello.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:36.910
It's me.

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.380
Did something happen?

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:41.950
There is something
I need to ask from you.

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:45.800
A request from you, Grandfather.
That's certainly a rare occurrence.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:47.330
What is it?

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.570
There is someone
I want you to protect.

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:54.270
Ketsu!

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:55.540
Metsu!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.810
This is too easy.

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:05.410
It's fine! It's better than
getting a strong one.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:07.420
By the way, where's Yoshimori?

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:08.710
I don't know.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:16.820
Yoshimori, there's one over there.

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:22.100
Yeah.
Hey, Madarao.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.640
Don't you think it's weird?

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.800
What is?

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.100
We've been dealing with
nothing but weaklings lately.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.910
The Kokuboro should be
up to something, right?

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.140
I know what you're saying.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:39.020
What do they plan to do if they
obtain the power of Karasumori?

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:42.880
I don't know. There's plenty of ways
to take advantage of it.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:49.300
That's only if they can
bring Karasumori into submission.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.960
But that's a one in
a million chance though.

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.630
One in a million, huh?

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.970
Will there be a day
when I can seal Karasumori?

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:57.430
But...

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:02.270
It might be the land they want.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.400
The land?

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:05.940
Yup. A land with power.

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:07.840
What do you mean?

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.050
You probably don't know this,

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:15.190
but Ayakashi that don't have
ties to humans, unlike us,

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.490
have nowhere to go.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:22.290
For some reason,
Ayakashi can't live without humans.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:27.600
With no place to live,
forgotten by humans,

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:29.260
those Ayakashi disappear.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:30.860
Oh.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.110
There it is.

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.370
Come on. Let's take care of it quickly.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.980
Staying up late is
bad for your health, Professor.

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:56.520
My mind is awake tonight.
I want to think a little more.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.800
Professor, we have intruders.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.140
Who's there?!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.610
I apologize for disturbing you
at this hour.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.380
I am Heisuke Matsudo's messenger.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:34.190
My master has given me
a letter for you.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.290
Heisuke...

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:38.760
Goodbye.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:41.530
Wait!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:48.840
Shuji-san!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.920
No, no, I wasn't sleeping.
I wasn't sleeping at all.

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.980
Can you still use the basic talismans
to ward off evil?

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:58.680
Heisuke is in danger.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:00.320
The Professor?

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:05.120
Yoshimori is at Karasumori.
I need your help.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:18.280
Father! My talismans will only
last a minute, at most.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.880
That's more than enough!
I'll protect you even if it kills me!

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:24.320
I never thought the talismans
the Professor taught me

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:25.880
would come in handy.

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:37.000
You must be the Sumimura's
Shigemori-sama.

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:42.190
I belong to the Night Troops.
My name is Mukade.

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:46.670
Father! The Magic Stone is flickering.
He's suspicious! Suspicious!

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:47.370
No.

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.380
You're one of Masamori's men?

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:50.240
Yes.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:53.040
Is Heisuke...
is Matsudo Heisuke all right?

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:56.780
I don't know.
I am on my way to guard him.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:10:59.910
Come this way.

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:04.550
I was told to take you to
the Matsudo residence as soon as possible.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:14.830
I can see it, too.

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:18.270
Please get on.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:22.970
Now please go.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.780
Professor... I hope you're all right...

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:32.080
To my dear friend,
Sumimura Shigemori-kun.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:36.560
Receiving this letter
signifies an emergency.

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:37.850
You must prepare yourself.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:40.990
Of course, I'm fully prepared
for anything.

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:44.760
I knew that I'd have to pay for
what I've done to this day.

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:52.400
I wish I could tease you or make you
listen to my long stories for a little longer.

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:56.600
But I accept that it won't be possible.
The cause for this lies with me.

00:11:57.310 --> 00:12:00.510
What are you thinking?
I'm the cause of it!

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:03.520
By giving him the human skin,

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:05.180
I knew Heisuke would get involved.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:09.110
I knew that!

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:19.960
Stop right there.

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:36.710
Wait!

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.920
They're taking them out one by one.

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:46.230
If my daughters are getting
defeated so easily...

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:48.920
They must be very powerful.

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:53.870
You don't have to go, Kagami-kun.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.000
I've already prepared for this.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:12:59.700
What?

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:03.840
Oh, come on.
You can't even get past these seals?

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.910
You're so weak.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:10.880
He thinks he can
protect himself with these?

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.010
Come on.

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:20.250
Here it is.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:55.690
Those won't work on me.

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:57.660
I don't know about that.

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:12.470
Oh, shoot. I forgot I'm not
supposed to make a mess in the house.

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:18.710
If only...

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.080
If only I'd stayed with him...

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:22.910
Are we there yet?

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.280
We'll arrive soon.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:34.130
Don't make an elderly man run.

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:35.600
Then just give up.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.870
You should be the one giving up.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.570
How do you like that?
You fell into my trap.

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:53.040
I see it. It's over there.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:56.420
Heisuke, I will protect you!

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.590
You think I can't
break through this Kekkai?

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:06.520
I only need to restrain you
for a little while.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:10.800
This gun and its bullets
have spells cast on them

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.670
to make them effective
against your kind.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:19.970
I'm very sorry.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.480
By the time we arrived, he was already...

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:25.110
What do you mean?!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.480
Heisuke!

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:36.230
I was too late!

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:38.800
Professor...

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:52.510
Well then, I guess he
should be dead by now.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.340
Matsudo Heisuke.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:06.150
I trust you completed your mission
without any problems, Shion.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:09.320
Do you think I would fail
against some old geezer?

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:15.230
That geezer thought he could kill me.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:23.800
This gun and bullets use spells
to make them effective against your kind.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.770
This is it.

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:28.710
So that gun works on humans, too, right?

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:29.480
What?

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.710
Do you have any other weapons?

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:31.840
What did you say?

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:34.520
Then I'll just use that.

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:37.090
You're spouting nonsense.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.860
This is it for you!

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:46.760
Well, my thread is connected to you now.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:49.600
So you're like my marionette.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:01.440
I don't like that an ordinary human
with no special powers killed my underlings.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:03.480
But I'm sure everything worked out fine.

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:07.780
I trust you made it look like a suicide?

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:11.780
I did it exactly how Hekian planned it.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.260
Go ask him the details.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:20.020
But that geezer...
something felt strange about him...

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.640
But it will be a drag to explain it
so I'll keep quiet.

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:40.550
Kai.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:47.390
That's odd. They usually
wake me up if I sleep this late.

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:50.590
Also, there is something else
I would like to say...

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:53.790
...something that I would've
preferred not to say.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.260
I'm very thankful to you.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:18:01.360
For a long time, you treated
this eccentric equally.

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:03.470
You are a splendid eccentric.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:07.510
Knowing you, you will probably
blame yourself for what happened.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.680
There is no need for that.

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:13.150
Once I have left this world,
forget about me.

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:15.950
Now, where will I go next?

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:19.620
Give my best regards to Shuji-kun.
Matsudo Heisuke.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:26.830
That fool, Heisuke!
You're a true fool!

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:28.960
So that's what happened...

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.940
Professor Matsudo took
good care of me, too.

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:35.130
But to your grandpa, he was-

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:48.520
Oh, my. Taking a nap in the sun?
You're so vulnerable right now.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.910
I should wake you up right away.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.930
I'll leave you alone for today.

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:11.770
I'm sorry I couldn't help.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:18.450
Shishio was at Karasumori.
You could've called me, you know.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.680
That is why you are a fool.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.760
Wh-What the heck?

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:29.420
What if they attacked Karasumori
in your absence?

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:32.320
Would you leave it to
the other two to fight?

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.020
Well...

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:38.590
Even if you lose a friend, a night that has
passed can never be taken back.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:42.570
You must never lose sight of
what you, yourself, must do.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:47.770
If I had stayed with him,
this would never have happened.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:50.940
Do you understand?

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:57.720
A Kekkaishi that regrets what happened
the night before is a hopeless fool...

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:00.820
But you hurried there
as fast as you could, right?

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:05.300
In real life, things don't go the same way
as it did for Moerus, do they?

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.430
How splendid!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:14.510
Those lamenting the ways of this world,
should sever ties to it completely.

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:17.880
True freedom reveals the world
in all its beautiful glory.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.170
Isn't that right, Kagami-kun?

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:24.640
I didn't think it would go so well.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:32.320
That thing was only
a fake wearing human skin.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:40.660
That thing was amazing.
It even fooled an Ayakashi.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:43.600
But won't they find out afterward?

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:44.810
It should be fine.

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:49.210
I've already made arrangements...
with Masamori-kun.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:53.710
Make it look like you're dead?

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:54.920
Yes.

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:59.750
And you want me to
help you fake your death?

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:02.290
I will pay you
a handsome reward, naturally.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:07.420
If you can make it look like I'm dead,
I'll be able to move around more freely.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:09.550
Very well.

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:12.800
He's a smart man.

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:16.300
I know he'll handle
the clean up responsibly.

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:25.740
I just hope Shigemori-kun
won't take it too hard.

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:30.610
Now, Kagami-kun.
I am now legally dead.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:32.250
But after my real death,

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:36.210
you can take my body or soul
just as our contract dictates.

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:40.750
However, my left leg goes to Hiromi.
Both kidneys go to Meg.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:44.030
My left arm goes to Diana.
My blood goes to Mayumi.

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:46.770
Both ears go to Sayoko.
My hair goes to Ming Mei.

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:49.430
My left eye goes to Beth.
My nose goes to Reika.

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:52.800
And everything that remains,
goes to you.

00:21:57.010 --> 00:22:02.920
So will you be my wings
for a little while longer?

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:06.480
Yes, Professor.

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:09.720
Let us go then.

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:11.010
To where?

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:12.630
To Kokuboro.

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:16.820
That's the reason
I made my friend cry.

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:52.160
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:54.030 --> 00:23:00.060
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:02.600
"What nerve"

00:23:03.010 --> 00:23:05.980
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:06.010 --> 00:23:09.710
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:16.090
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:21.120
I hate studying,
I like P.E. Okay

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:23.060
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:28.330
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:28.370 --> 00:23:31.860
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:35.970
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:50.460 --> 00:24:00.800
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
